Thu gọn\r\n                                    \n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n\n<span>27/06/2026 | 21:28</span>\n</div>\n<h3>\r\n                                        4h\r\n                                    </h3>\n</div>\n<div>\n<img src=\"https://static.vnncdn.net/v1/icon/down-arrow.svg\"/>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<figure><picture><!--[if IE 9]><video style=\"display: none;\"><![endif]--><source><!--[if IE 9]></video><![endif]--><img alt=\"DR Congo vs Uzbekistan VS Lead.jpg\" src=\"https://static-images.vnncdn.net/vps_images_publish/000001/000003/2026/6/27/dr-congo-vs-uzbekistan-vs-lead-2496.jpg?width=0&amp;s=KWY_aV5hcWJd4i0YQLoJkg\"/></source></picture>\n<figcaption>CHDC Congo quyết tâm giành chiến thắng - Ảnh: Khelnow</figcaption>\n</figure>\n</div>\n<div>\r\n                                    Thu gọn\r\n                                    \n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div>\r\n                Dữ liệu đang được cập nhật!\r\n            </div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!-- END COMPONENT:: COMPONENT002494 -->\n<!-- BEGIN COMPONENT:: COMPONENT002778 -->\n<!-- END COMPONENT:: COMPONENT002778 -->\n</div></body></html>"}